{"n":102,"name":"At-Takathur","nameAr":"التكاثر","meaning":"The Rivalry in world increase","ayahs":8,"place":"makkah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":30,"ar":"أَلْهَىٰكُمُ ٱلتَّكَاثُرُ","en":"Competition in [worldly] increase diverts you","w":[{"ar":"أَلْهَىٰكُمُ","tr":"alhākumu","en":"Diverts you","root":"لهو","lem":"أَلْهَى"},{"ar":"ٱلتَّكَاثُرُ","tr":"l-takāthuru","en":"the competition to increase","root":"كثر","lem":"تَكاثُر"}]},{"n":2,"juz":30,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ زُرْتُمُ ٱلْمَقَابِرَ","en":"Until you visit the graveyards.","w":[{"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","tr":"ḥattā","en":"Until"},{"ar":"زُرْتُمُ","tr":"zur'tumu","en":"you visit","root":"زور","lem":"زُرْ"},{"ar":"ٱلْمَقَابِرَ","tr":"l-maqābira","en":"the graves","root":"قبر","lem":"مَقابِر"}]},{"n":3,"juz":30,"ar":"كَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَمُونَ","en":"No! You are going to know.","w":[{"ar":"كَلَّا","tr":"kallā","en":"Nay"},{"ar":"سَوْفَ","tr":"sawfa","en":"Soon"},{"ar":"تَعْلَمُونَ","tr":"taʿlamūna","en":"you will know","root":"علم","lem":"عَلِمَ"}]},{"n":4,"juz":30,"ar":"ثُمَّ كَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَمُونَ","en":"Then, no! You are going to know.","w":[{"ar":"ثُمَّ","tr":"thumma","en":"Then"},{"ar":"كَلَّا","tr":"kallā","en":"nay"},{"ar":"سَوْفَ","tr":"sawfa","en":"Soon"},{"ar":"تَعْلَمُونَ","tr":"taʿlamūna","en":"you will know","root":"علم","lem":"عَلِمَ"}]},{"n":5,"juz":30,"ar":"كَلَّا لَوْ تَعْلَمُونَ عِلْمَ ٱلْيَقِينِ","en":"No! If you only knew with knowledge of certainty...","w":[{"ar":"كَلَّا","tr":"kallā","en":"Nay"},{"ar":"لَوْ","tr":"law","en":"If"},{"ar":"تَعْلَمُونَ","tr":"taʿlamūna","en":"you know","root":"علم","lem":"عَلِمَ"},{"ar":"عِلْمَ","tr":"ʿil'ma","en":"(with) a knowledge","root":"علم","lem":"عِلْم"},{"ar":"ٱلْيَقِينِ","tr":"l-yaqīni","en":"(of) certainty","root":"يقن","lem":"يَقِين"}]},{"n":6,"juz":30,"ar":"لَتَرَوُنَّ ٱلْجَحِيمَ","en":"You will surely see the Hellfire.","w":[{"ar":"لَتَرَوُنَّ","tr":"latarawunna","en":"Surely you will see","root":"رأي","lem":"رَأَى"},{"ar":"ٱلْجَحِيمَ","tr":"l-jaḥīma","en":"the Hellfire","root":"جحم","lem":"جَحِيم"}]},{"n":7,"juz":30,"ar":"ثُمَّ لَتَرَوُنَّهَا عَيْنَ ٱلْيَقِينِ","en":"Then you will surely see it with the eye of certainty.","w":[{"ar":"ثُمَّ","tr":"thumma","en":"Then"},{"ar":"لَتَرَوُنَّهَا","tr":"latarawunnahā","en":"surely you will see it","root":"رأي","lem":"رَأَى"},{"ar":"عَيْنَ","tr":"ʿayna","en":"(with the) eye","root":"عين","lem":"عَيْن"},{"ar":"ٱلْيَقِينِ","tr":"l-yaqīni","en":"(of) certainty","root":"يقن","lem":"يَقِين"}]},{"n":8,"juz":30,"ar":"ثُمَّ لَتُسْـَٔلُنَّ يَوْمَئِذٍ عَنِ ٱلنَّعِيمِ","en":"Then you will surely be asked that Day about pleasure.","w":[{"ar":"ثُمَّ","tr":"thumma","en":"Then"},{"ar":"لَتُسْـَٔلُنَّ","tr":"latus'alunna","en":"surely you will be asked","root":"سأل","lem":"سَأَلَ"},{"ar":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","tr":"yawma-idhin","en":"that Day","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"عَنِ","tr":"ʿani","en":"about"},{"ar":"ٱلنَّعِيمِ","tr":"l-naʿīmi","en":"the pleasures","root":"نعم","lem":"نَعِيم"}]}]}